shot title
mark title
press START 150
wait 4.0
shot profile-select
mark profile-select
press A
wait 2.0
shot keyboard
press A
wait 1.0
shot name
press Y
wait 3.0
shot main-menu
mark profile-created
axis LX max
axis LX mid
